          "url": "https://github.com/Gitlawb/openclaude",
          "summary_short": {
            "zh": "openclaude 是一个基于 TypeScript 的命令行 AI 代理，目标是“随处运行、随物可接”。它通过统一的终端接口，将不同模型、API 和工具组合在一起，降低多 AI 助手带来的割裂感。其最大特点是与具体供应商解耦，可灵活替换后端，并借助扩展机制融入现有开发流程。适合用于自动化复杂任务、在持续集成中调度智能体，或作为原型工具快速对比不同模型效果。你也可以把它当作脚手架，改造出贴合自己业务场景的专属 CLI 智能工具，从而更自主地控制数据流向与执行逻辑。",
            "en": "openclaude is a TypeScript-based command-line AI agent designed to run across any environment and work with virtually any model, API, or tool. It solves the fragmentation of AI assistants by offering a single, portable interface for coding and automation tasks. Its key strength …",
            "es": "openclaude is a TypeScript-based command-line AI agent designed to run across any environment and work with virtually any model, API, or tool. It solves the fragmentation of AI assistants by offering a single, portable interface for coding and automation tasks. Its key strength …"
